      "text": "Dify is an open-source platform for building LLM applications, agentic workflows, and RAG pipelines. This monorepo contains the backend API (`api/`), frontend application (`web/`), deployment assets (`docker/`), standalone agent backend (`dify-agent/`), CLI (`cli/`), and end-to-end suite (`e2e/`). F"
